# head/adult/youth/nose_upturned: the youth's upturned nose (girls)
# P2b FACES (wave 2): GENERATED from the adult maps by the FACES spec (the boy = the man's views, the girl = the
# woman's as `when girl replace`); edit the adult maps, then regenerate. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
body youth
role nose upturned
layer face
anchor head
keys rest

view D key rest origin -7 -11
|tr

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -14 -9
|.q.
|ssq

view L key rest origin 1 -9
|.q.
|qtt
